@startuml
!theme plain
title Generation-bound native restart recovery
hide empty description
[*] --> Running
Running --> Saving : execute admitted; native durable profile
Running --> Running : busy / unsupported / allocation rejection
Saving --> Running : save failure; no unresolved intent
Saving --> IntentPublished : generation validated; intent read back
IntentPublished --> ReplacingWorld : revalidate; reboot or shutdown
IntentPublished --> Running : returned failure; owned intent consumed
IntentPublished --> RecoveryHold : intent cleanup fails
ReplacingWorld --> StartupHold : new process detects intent
StartupHold --> Preflight : intent and dimension validation
Preflight --> RecoveryHold : malformed / mismatch / budget refusal
Preflight --> Importing : matching completed generation
Importing --> RecoveryHold : post-mutation failure
Importing --> ConsumingIntent : import complete
ConsumingIntent --> RecoveryHold : intent changed / deletion fails
ConsumingIntent --> ReclaimPlayers : matching intent consumed
ReclaimPlayers --> Running : eligible clients restored
RecoveryHold --> Preflight : explicit resume; no partial failed import
note right of RecoveryHold
No fresh-round fallback or automatic retry.
A partial failed import requires restarting
from the original map with preserved files.
end note
@enduml
